Subject: [PATCH 5/9] a5xx: add tests, docs, installer and KWin workarounds

Add the headless/on-screen Vulkan tests, stress/bench/log collectors, bring-up and stability notes, the install/rollback helper and the KWin environment workarounds required on the target device.

Signed-off-by: Kulesha Evgeniy <voovdop@gmail.com>
